==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*5 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Just stall THE SLOTH with meatshields until you have enough for [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]]. Zroco is not an issue here as you can just bring damage dealers to kill it. [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] can also be helpful here to chip THE SLOTH's health.

